<Layout title="tHeRe's nO WaY We lOsE ThIs™">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <img src="/assets/Ep_7_Keyart_4k.jpg" alt="Valorant Key Art" />
      <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      <div class="scanlines"></div>
      <div class="hero-noise"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-tag">
        <span class="tag-dot"></span>
        TEAM ROSTER // EST. 2020
        <span class="tag-dot"></span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="glitch" data-text="tHeRe's nO WaY We lOsE ThIs™">tHeRe's nO WaY We lOsE ThIs&#8482;</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">tHeRe's nO WaY We lOsE ThIs&#8482;</p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <span class="stat-num count-up" data-target="5">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">PLAYERS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <span class="stat-num">GOLD</span>
          <span class="stat-label">AVG RANK</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
          <span class="stat-num count-up" data-target="49" data-suffix="%">0%</span>
          <span class="stat-label">WIN RATE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#roster" class="hero-cta">MEET THE SQUAD</a>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-indicator">
      <div class="scroll-line"></div>
      <span>SCROLL</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">// 001</span>
      <h2>THE VIBE</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="about-lead">We're not good. But we're here. And we're not leaving. Purchance.</p>
        <p>It always starts the same way: Doodlleus drops a 'Sploink?' or a 'Chimchimcheroo?' in the group chat. Neilatron says 'Aye.' TJC says 'I could do exactly one.' Pretty Mouth Boy says he's not a gamer anymore, then queues up anyway. Chill Good Night says 'Mayb.' Five players. One of us is in Factorio. One of us is asleep. One of us is dying in enemy spawn. One of us is an AI pretending to be human. One of us has never gotten an ace. The gaming chair loses power at 11pm. Nobody has learned a lineup. Everyone buys Odins just to watch the enemy team moan in chat. But somehow? tHeRe's nO WaY We lOsE ThIs&#8482;.</p>
        <div class="about-values">
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">&#9670;</span>
            <span>GAMING CHAIR POWER EXPIRES AT 11PM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">&#9670;</span>
            <span>WHEN WE LOSE, WE BLAME CHILL GOOD NIGHT</span>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">&#9670;</span>
            <span>PRETTY MOUTH BOY DIES FIRST (FACTORIO)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">&#9670;</span>
            <span>ODIN EVERY ROUND (CRY ABOUT IT)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/assets/Ep8A1_Riot Games.com Product Card 1920x1080_.jpg" alt="Team vibes" />
        <div class="about-image-accent"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROSTER -->
  <section class="roster" id="roster">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">// 002</span>
      <h2>THE ROSTER</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="player-grid">
      {players.map((player, i) => (
        <a href={`/players/${player.slug}`} class={`player-card ability-${player.slug}`} style={`--accent: ${player.accent}; --delay: ${i * 0.1}s`}>
